    <h2>Deploying the Full AI Team</h2>
    <p>We didn't just give Mike a chatbot. We deployed a coordinated AI workforce &mdash; five specialized bots, each handling a critical function of his business, all orchestrated by Sir Winchester III.</p>

    <ul class="solution-list">
      <li><span class="solution-icon">&#127913;</span> <strong>Sir Winchester III</strong> became Mike's Chief of Staff &mdash; triaging every email, drafting responses in Mike's voice, managing his calendar, and delegating tasks to the rest of the team.</li>
      <li><span class="solution-icon">&#128202;</span> <strong>Victoria Sterling</strong> built automated dashboards showing AUM growth, client engagement, and revenue trends. Mike now starts each day with a 60-second briefing instead of an hour of spreadsheets.</li>
      <li><span class="solution-icon">&#128737;</span> <strong>Marcus Compliance</strong> mapped every regulatory deadline, filing requirement, and audit trigger. Nothing gets missed. Nothing gets close to missed.</li>
      <li><span class="solution-icon">&#128221;</span> <strong>Isabella Content</strong> launched a weekly blog, a monthly client newsletter, and a LinkedIn presence &mdash; all in Mike's voice, all generating inbound leads.</li>
      <li><span class="solution-icon">&#127919;</span> <strong>Alexander Prospect</strong> took over lead qualification and follow-up. New inquiries get a personalized response within 15 minutes, 24/7.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

