        <span class="timeline-week">Week 1</span>
        <h3>Discovery &amp; Winchester Deployment</h3>
        <p>We mapped Mike's email patterns, calendar structure, and communication style. Winchester went live on day 5, starting with email triage in supervised mode &mdash; drafting responses for Mike's approval before sending.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
